{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were enjoying a peaceful camping night in a mountain shrouded in silence and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/campfire.png?t=1743831221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The warm glow of the campfire cast flickering shadows when, suddenly, your eyes caught sight of something unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/something.png?t=1743831221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only thing I have at hand is an unreliable lamp. To reveal its identity, you step deep into the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/forest.png?t=1743831221\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633580?t=1743831221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633580?t=1743831221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/ed1b94cf7283c7e345bfe91e19a54df423faee02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743831221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/ed1b94cf7283c7e345bfe91e19a54df423faee02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743831221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were enjoying a peaceful camping night in a mountain shrouded in silence and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/campfire.png?t=1743831221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The warm glow of the campfire cast f